Font atlas v3 → v4: a kerning-pair section appended after coverage. The baker
walks GPOS lookupType 2 (format 1 pair sets and format 2 class defs, class 0
reconstructed from coverage) and writes i8 logical-px deltas. The core applies
them in measure_run and layout_run. A core that cannot apply the pairs refuses
the blob; v2 and v3 still load.

`git apply` skips everything above the first `diff --git`.

